s1-p29 = prose (cons "A machine is one particular process in this account. Under the evaluator-adequacy and machine-simulation premises of §9.2, a realization of one evaluator executes every represented term, including the represented interpreters and transformations. Direct compilation supplies other realizations with their own evidence. This is the implementation dimension of the same construction, not the premise from which the study of nature, interpretation, or rational action begins." nil)
